[I] A tool for creating gif animations

[T] Gifsicle is a command-line tool for creating, editing, and getting
[T] information about GIF images and animations. Making a GIF animation
[T] with gifsicle is easy.

[U] http://www.lcdf.org/gifsicle/

[A] Eddie Kohler
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/multimedia
[F] CROSS

[L] OpenSource
[V] 1.98

[D] ba3a28b05b207ae417de129d0df268ec32683df7e720e79a70af276d gifsicle-1.98.tar.gz http://www.lcdf.org/gifsicle/

var_append confopt ' ' '--enable-gifview --enable-gifdiff --disable-ungif --with-x'
